(wrote experiment_comparison.csv)

Caveats:
 - Every K46-labelled row in this dataset is a multi-grade layered / functionally graded panel from a
   single paper, so there is no monolithic epoxy+K46 modulus-vs-vf curve here to validate against;
   the model curve above is a prediction, not a fit.
 - Measured syntactic-foam moduli typically sit 20-40% below HP-MT (matrix porosity, imperfect
   interfacial bonding, particle breakage); larger gaps here also reflect the grade mismatch.
 - No constant was tuned and no experimental value was hard-coded to close that gap.
